{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Active Raid 2nd Season","The nation's capital, Tokyo, where the Space Elevator Project is proceeding at full tilt, in preparation for the summit. Established to fight crime based around Willwear, enhanced armor, is the Special Public Security Fifth Division Third Mobile Assault Eighth Unit—Unit 8 in short. Having saved Japan from Logos' terrorism, Unit 8 was now become really popular around the country. However, crimes misusing Willwear showed no signs of slowing down. In fact, they kept escalating. Kuroki and the rest of Unit 8 now have new members on their side, and continue to fight evil crimes with their brains, bravery, and the gift of gab—now with the help of civilian police.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["アクティヴレイド -機動強襲室第八係- 2nd",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":31790,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-32301","ids":{"shikimori":32301,"mal":32301,"anilist":21534,"kodik":"serial-28681"},"kodikIds":["serial-28681"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-28681":"2020-08-14T20:45:34Z"},"title":"Активный рейд: Мобильная боевая дивизия, восьмой отряд 2","originalTitle":"Active Raid: Kidou Kyoushuushitsu Dai Hachi Gakari - 2nd","alt":"Активный рейд: Мобильная боевая дивизия, восьмой отряд 2 / Active Raid: Special Public Security Fifth Division Third Mobile Assault Eighth Unit - Second Active Raid 2nd Season アクティヴレイド -機動強襲室第八係- 2nd","description":"Действие разворачивается в одном из районов Токио, погрязшем в трясине преступности. В центре сюжета — 8-й отряд 3-й мобильной штурмовой дивизии 5-го специального отдела общественной безопасности, известный в народе как «Восьмёрка». Чтобы противостоять разгулу преступности, его бойцы облачаются в силовую броню — экзоскелеты «Willwear».","year":2016,"type":"TV","genres":["Фантастика","взрослые персонажи","меха"],"rating":6.33,"popularity":5280,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[31790],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/32301/5a503030f94